INT. MOROCCAN HOTEL - NIGHT

Rachel Williams stands at the front desk with Anna Sorokin while the hotel waits for payment.

NARRATOR
Rachel travelled to Morocco with Anna, and when Anna's cards failed, Rachel put the hotel bill on her work card. Rachel remained Anna's friend only because Anna paid for luxuries, then abandoned her as soon as Anna could no longer pay.
